# Feature pattern

Screen logic lives in `src/features/<kebab-name>/`:

```
src/features/<name>/
  <name>.feature.tsx
  api/                     # optional GraphQL for this feature
  components/              # feature-private UI
  index.ts
```

Routes in `src/app/` stay thin.

## Naming

- Files: kebab-case with suffix (`*.feature.tsx`, `*.component.tsx`, `*.helpers.ts`)
- Components: PascalCase
- GraphQL docs: SCREAMING_SNAKE

Tabs (P0): Overview | Reservations | Floor | Messages | More.
Waitlist is a stack screen from Overview (and secondary from Reservations).
Notifications bell lives in the header, not the tab bar.
